<title>SENEGAL: TENNIS-EURO/AFRICAN ZONE GROUP THREE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-EURO/AFRICAN ZONE GROUP THREE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DAKAR 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Davis Cup Euro/African</p>
<p>zone group three tennis matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>Mustapha Azara (Turkey) beat Goran Popov (Macedonia) 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Artak Harutyunyan (Armenia) beat Samuel Gebriel (Ethiopia) 6-2</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>Yohannes Setegne (Ethiopia) beat David Babayan (Armenia) 6-4</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Pascal Schaul (Luxemburg) beat Jean Noel Said (Senegal 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>Yahiya Doumbia (Senegal) beat Sacha Thoma (luxemburg) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Eldar Mustafic (Bosnia) beat Christian Rosti (San Marino) 7-5</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>Merid Zahirovic (Bosnia) beat Domenico Vicini (San Marino) 7-6</p>
<p>7-6</p>
</text>
